08-Client Endpoint
Objective: 
--Stand up an Windows 11 VM Client and join it to the domain.

Method:
--Downloaded fresh windows 11 ISO from microsoft
--Verified file hash in powershell using  `Get-FileHash` followed by absolute path to ISO image, matching Output to Microsoft Provided Hash output. Files Matched.
--verified Win11 Pro in VM installer.
--Setup Network Adapters, one facing internet (NAT) and one facing host-dns (host-only adapter)
--configured Windows 11 Pro language and preferences.
--Esablished default user account
--Updated windows
--took clean save state snapshot of VM
